WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:53.560 --> 00:01:57.040
The secret ballot was unanimous.

00:01:57.050 --> 00:02:00.530
It is decided that Shinobu Mariko-san will be expelled from the Sorority.

00:02:04.210 --> 00:02:06.490
That's not fair! That's too severe!

00:02:06.720 --> 00:02:07.930
This is too one-sided!

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.940
Why didn't you listen to Shinobu-san's side of the story?

00:02:11.140 --> 00:02:12.210
Misonoo-san!

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:13.880
You can't speak to her like that!

00:02:14.040 --> 00:02:16.920
Do you know what you're saying?

00:02:18.610 --> 00:02:20.760
Then, I will leave the Sorority too!

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:22.770
Right now! Right here!

00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:32.180
<i>I just now left the Sorority!</i>

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:38.510
<b>29. The Assembly</b>

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.210
What?! You quit the Sorority?

00:02:46.280 --> 00:02:49.490
Yes. I quit. Just now.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:56.480
They expelled Mariko-san, so I decided to leave, too.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:00.070
Besides, I think I would have decided to leave anyway.

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.290
So, what about the cake?

00:03:10.270 --> 00:03:12.010
You know, for Mariko-san!

00:03:12.510 --> 00:03:13.510
Oh yeah...

00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:18.050
Wow! Cranberry cheesecake!

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:20.390
I've always wanted to try some!

00:03:20.530 --> 00:03:21.660
Oh, good!

00:03:21.800 --> 00:03:22.740
I'm thrilled.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:24.280
It was Tomoko who picked it out.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:26.090
Thank you, Tomoko-san!

00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:28.140
A lucky guess...

00:03:28.280 --> 00:03:31.290
Come on, Tomoko. Shall we eat?

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:34.310
Um... thanks... later.

00:03:35.460 --> 00:03:37.130
What's wrong with Tomoko-san?

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:40.380
Tomoko's a little strange, sometimes.

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:43.220
Ah... Two or three lost seagulls... headed west,

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:45.430
...searching for somewhere tp spend the night...

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:46.360
What?

00:03:49.900 --> 00:03:51.710
Thanks, Tomoko-san.

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:55.650
I'm fine. I knew I'd be expelled.

00:03:55.980 --> 00:04:00.810
They called me on the phone... It sounded like it was Mona-Lisa-sama.

00:04:01.360 --> 00:04:05.050
She said that as of yesterday, I was expelled...

00:04:06.530 --> 00:04:08.340
But it doesn't matter anymore.

00:04:08.880 --> 00:04:11.620
Don't worry, I'll be fine.

00:04:13.310 --> 00:04:18.610
I my case, I never really gave the Sorority a second thought.

00:04:19.300 --> 00:04:22.720
I really couldn't have cared less about it.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:27.610
The more snobbish they got, the more I disliked the whole idea.

00:04:28.240 --> 00:04:32.200
But, I know that Nanako really got caught up in it,

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:35.750
...and she's put out so much effort, and...

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.230
What?

00:04:39.370 --> 00:04:40.640
Tomoko!

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:42.790
It didn't matter! It was nothing!

00:04:43.020 --> 00:04:44.430
Really?

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:46.570
All that shouting and crying on the swing...

00:04:46.570 --> 00:04:49.920
That was NOTHING? Did you forget?

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:52.440
Yes, I've completely forgotten all that!

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:55.320
Like I told you, I'd been thinking about quitting anyway.

00:04:55.510 --> 00:04:59.120
Nanako-san... you mean... you quit the Sorority?

00:04:59.500 --> 00:05:00.510
Yes.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.390
Because of me?

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:03.790
No!

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:05.580
I'm sorry...!

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.530
No! Oh, for goodness sake!

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:11.880
Come on, Tomoko! How can it be such a big deal with you?

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:15.100
It's OK! If it's OK with you, it's OK.

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:17.720
That's it. End of story.

00:05:18.890 --> 00:05:19.960
Tomoko!

00:05:20.300 --> 00:05:21.380
Tomoko-san!

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.250
I think I'll have some cake.

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.270
Ummm, it's delicious!

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.820
So that's what it's like.

00:05:34.820 --> 00:05:36.290
With the Sorority, I mean.

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:37.230
What?

00:05:38.280 --> 00:05:42.040
I guess so. Once you've been in the Sorority, you think nothing of it.

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:49.350
Originally I thought there might be more to it than that.

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:51.290
But, everything's fine now.

00:05:51.730 --> 00:05:54.480
I don't understand what you're saying, Tomoko...

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:57.990
Good tea! Darjeeling, I guess?

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:11.010
<i>My dear Brother...</i>

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:15.830
<i>The school decided on a punishment for Mariko-san.</i>

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:19.070
<i>She was to be suspended 3 months.</i>

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:22.710
They must be kidding!

00:06:22.850 --> 00:06:25.930
What's the school think it's doing, anyway?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:30.750
What good does it do to put her life on hold for three months?

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:35.470
This was because some low-life girl was slandering her, that's all.

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:36.750
Oh!

00:06:38.180 --> 00:06:41.470
"Low life"? Who says so?

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:47.350
Misaki-san was hurt! She could have died!

00:06:47.590 --> 00:06:51.550
And you're siding with the attempted murderer?!

00:06:51.760 --> 00:06:53.500
Yeah! You got a problem with that?

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.980
"...could have died"? That's ridiculous.

00:06:57.170 --> 00:07:01.790
Oh, wow. Miss Expelled-by-the-Sorority sure is taking BIG now.

00:07:03.070 --> 00:07:04.070
Tomoko!

00:07:04.070 --> 00:07:07.350
I've had it with you bitches!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:10.370
You're in for it!

00:07:14.100 --> 00:07:15.770
That HURTS, damn it!

00:07:22.650 --> 00:07:26.000
Stop it! I'm not kidding! Cut it out!

00:07:27.160 --> 00:07:29.840
You're the only one who can end this.

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:30.940
What?

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:34.390
Do it. Now.

00:07:37.530 --> 00:07:40.550
Stop it! Please! Stop...!

00:07:52.080 --> 00:07:55.760
Strange. You don't usually come to hear me play.

00:07:56.030 --> 00:07:58.650
I thought we could talk.

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.230
Sure. About what, pray tell?

00:08:03.690 --> 00:08:07.440
Did you know Misonoo Nanako left the Sorority?

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:12.270
I heard something. A rumor.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:13.600
And...?

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:14.980
Ummm.

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:24.730
So?

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:27.740
What is it?

00:08:28.280 --> 00:08:29.690
Well... um.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.660
Maybe... this isn't the place or time.

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.480
What's the matter? Not feeling outspoken today?

00:08:36.650 --> 00:08:41.340
I'll let you know... before I do it.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:44.630
Let's wait, then.

00:09:09.080 --> 00:09:10.160
How's the pain?

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:13.220
There is some, now and then. Just a bit.

00:09:13.310 --> 00:09:16.660
It's happening more and more often.

00:09:17.100 --> 00:09:18.310
Am I right?

00:09:19.680 --> 00:09:23.570
Please... you must tell me everything.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:26.430
Um... well...

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:42.950
Coming! That must be Nanako and the others.

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:44.830
Come in!

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:47.430
Hi again! We're back!

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.910
Wow, Tomoko-san, what happened to your face?

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:55.690
Just a rash. I have an allergy. It's nothing.

00:09:55.940 --> 00:09:59.360
Algebra and geometry are at the scheduled point in the syllabus,

00:09:59.360 --> 00:10:02.510
...but in English class today...

00:10:02.510 --> 00:10:04.320
...we covered up to here and we're supposed to...

00:10:04.320 --> 00:10:07.130
Never mind, Nanako-san. It's OK.

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:10.140
I can't go to school for the next 3 months anyway.

00:10:11.280 --> 00:10:12.220
But...

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:14.900
I'm happy just to see you everyday.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:18.900
There's no point in studying. It wouldn't stick with me anyway.

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:25.290
By the way, how is she?

00:10:25.290 --> 00:10:27.770
That girl... Misaki-san.

00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.580
She... she was at school. Today.

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:33.590
I saw her.

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:34.760
Hmmm...

00:10:37.950 --> 00:10:42.440
Misaki-san and I have constantly been rivals since Junior High School.

00:10:42.620 --> 00:10:46.030
I despise her more than anyone else I've ever known.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:51.380
She's an arrogant, self-centered braggart who has to be first at everything.

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.040
And she's utterly alone and desperately lonely.

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:01.100
But... last night I couldn't sleep...

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:06.020
My eyes stared into that awful darkness and I thought of her.

00:11:07.030 --> 00:11:08.500
Then I finally understood.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:14.190
She... she and I are too much alike!

00:11:14.710 --> 00:11:19.600
Those very things I can't forgive myself - I see them all in her too!

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:29.390
How could I... how could I have been so cruel!

00:11:32.410 --> 00:11:34.820
Mariko! Mariko!

00:11:34.820 --> 00:11:36.430
Stop, Mariko!

00:11:37.120 --> 00:11:40.470
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, Misaki-san!

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.720
What the matter? What is it, Halloween?

00:12:01.020 --> 00:12:04.430
You've been waiting for me to come home?

00:12:04.850 --> 00:12:06.390
Thank you, Halloween...

00:12:18.360 --> 00:12:19.770
<i>My Dear Brother...</i>

00:12:20.720 --> 00:12:24.140
<i>A victim... and an assailant.</i>

00:12:24.540 --> 00:12:27.960
<i>Which of them suffered the greater pain?</i>

00:12:30.310 --> 00:12:34.930
<i>Suspension... expulsion...</i>

00:12:34.930 --> 00:12:40.490
<i>Perhaps in the long run, these things are unimportant.</i>

00:12:54.130 --> 00:12:56.630
I think I should finish telling you the rest of the story.

00:12:57.550 --> 00:13:01.500
Hey... I hope you realize you're invading my bedroom.

00:13:02.420 --> 00:13:04.490
At the next student assembly...

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.150
"Don't disturb..."

00:13:08.570 --> 00:13:11.050
At the next assembly,

00:13:11.050 --> 00:13:13.630
...I'll make a motion to abolish the Sorority.

00:13:23.680 --> 00:13:24.600
What did you say?

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.050
Is there something you want?

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.010
No, not really.

00:13:52.310 --> 00:13:54.000
Go home, then.

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:57.340
You can't just ride the club's horses anytime you want.

00:13:57.460 --> 00:14:00.290
I asked for permission, and got it.

00:14:00.800 --> 00:14:01.440
Oh?

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:07.240
Let's race! Please. Just you and me.

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:26.200
You want to abolish the Sorority?!!

00:14:26.570 --> 00:14:27.270
Yes.

00:14:27.390 --> 00:14:29.620
You can't be serious! You can't!

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:32.320
I couldn't be more serious.

00:14:32.440 --> 00:14:37.170
But why? You don't give a damn about the Sorority!

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:39.030
Wouldn't you be meddling in someone else's business?

00:14:39.330 --> 00:14:40.820
Meddling?

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:42.910
I hardly think it is meddling.

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:47.740
The problem is that the Sorority has become a permanent school tradition.

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.280
It would be too cruel.

00:14:50.830 --> 00:14:51.610
Cruel?

00:14:51.730 --> 00:14:56.030
Because, the Sorority is - the Sorority is Fukiko-sama herself!

00:14:56.270 --> 00:15:00.800
This is just the final legacy of a corrupt tradition.

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:04.100
She may be the head of the Sorority,

00:15:04.220 --> 00:15:05.940
...but she and the Sorority are separate things!

00:15:06.060 --> 00:15:06.980
But her pride!

00:15:07.100 --> 00:15:10.500
That's her final reserve of dignity and pride!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:13.990
I'm sorry, I shouldn't have mentioned it.

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.610
I'll do this on my own.

00:15:20.930 --> 00:15:23.110
No! I can't let you do it!

00:15:28.040 --> 00:15:32.540
Her self-respect is so vital I would sacrifice my life for it!

00:15:32.660 --> 00:15:34.430
You're a strong one, Rei.

00:15:35.400 --> 00:15:38.070
But for me, I love living.

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.760
Life is so precious to me,

00:15:40.880 --> 00:15:42.410
...I couldn't bear to lose it.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:08.940
I am the winner, Rei.

00:16:10.990 --> 00:16:12.610
Yes, Fukiko-sama...!

00:16:33.070 --> 00:16:35.210
<i>Something strange was in the air that day.</i>

00:16:35.810 --> 00:16:40.470
<i>All the white doves had left the campus.</i>

00:16:40.960 --> 00:16:44.560
<i>Not once that morning did I hear the flapping of wings.</i>

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:49.110
<i>Surely I was not the only one who noticed, though.</i>

00:16:51.270 --> 00:16:52.940
<i>Brother, Dear Brother,</i>

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:56.730
<i>...in the afternoon, the student assembly was convened.</i>

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:03.790
Say, Tomoko...

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:04.410
Yes?

00:17:04.930 --> 00:17:06.680
Do you know anything about... the doves?

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:08.900
Doves? What doves?

00:17:16.420 --> 00:17:20.290
Today, on the occasion of the school's 90th anniversary,

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:24.110
...we have called this first assembly of the year.

00:17:27.470 --> 00:17:32.470
First, permit me to begin by going over today's agenda...

00:17:32.590 --> 00:17:34.110
What was that about the doves?

00:17:34.960 --> 00:17:36.880
Nothing. Never mind...

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:40.730
[We have issues regarding scholastic grading practices, and the issue of on-campus clubs...]

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:43.750
Say, why don't we take Mariko-san out today? [We have issues regarding scholastic grading practices, and the issue of on-campus clubs...]

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:47.800
That's a good idea. She's been stuck inside the house. [We have issues regarding scholastic grading practices, and the issue of on-campus clubs...]

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:49.970
How about Fairyland? [...which are already planning their activities for the first half of the year...]

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:51.810
Sure! That'll do. [...which are already planning their activities for the first half of the year...]

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:52.960
That is all.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:58.450
Now, we may proceed on to the discussion.

00:17:59.110 --> 00:17:59.770
Madam President!

00:18:05.820 --> 00:18:07.200
I want to make a motion.

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:14.840
Go ahead, B-class freshman Orihara-san.

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:16.620
You may proceed.

00:18:16.970 --> 00:18:18.680
Thank you, Madam President.

00:18:19.740 --> 00:18:22.560
I move that the Sorority be abolished.

00:18:38.670 --> 00:18:42.610
Excuse me... Could you repeat that, please?

00:18:45.300 --> 00:18:47.580
I move that the Sorority be abolished!

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:57.530
<i>Kaoru-no-Kimi...!</i>

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.280
Order! Quiet, please!

00:19:15.220 --> 00:19:18.720
Abolish the Sorority...?

00:19:18.840 --> 00:19:22.710
Yes, that's right. Let's put it to a discussion.

00:19:22.980 --> 00:19:26.540
I'm sorry, but I must reject this motion.

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:27.890
Why?!

00:19:28.010 --> 00:19:32.050
Because the Sorority is part of Seiran's tradition.

00:19:32.170 --> 00:19:34.440
A school with a traditional caste system?

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.410
A "caste system"?

00:19:42.980 --> 00:19:45.420
How can you call it a caste system?

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:49.500
The system assigns a value to each person.

00:19:50.730 --> 00:19:53.100
That value determines how much their future is worth.

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:58.850
"We're different from other students!" "We're special and elite!"

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:02.820
Then, this idiocy goes on and on each year,

00:20:02.840 --> 00:20:07.910
...and students fight each other to get in, and many get hurt doing so!

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.000
We would be better off without the Sorority.

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:14.400
We must abolish the Sorority now!

00:20:14.520 --> 00:20:16.880
Kaoru-no-Kimi is right!

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:20.030
Yes, it's wrong that the Sorority is so special!

00:20:20.060 --> 00:20:22.590
It really is a sort of caste system!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:26.830
No, listen, Seiran is great because of the Sorority!

00:20:26.950 --> 00:20:29.240
Yes, let's abolish the Sorority!

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:31.830
Oh...!

00:20:32.560 --> 00:20:33.020
What?

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:34.360
The Doves! <i></i>

00:20:34.590 --> 00:20:35.070
The Doves! What?

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:38.490
<i>The doves have returned, my brother...</i>

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:57.240
Quiet! Quiet, everyone!

00:20:57.270 --> 00:20:59.190
Please shut up, all of you!

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:08.800
Anyone wanting to speak must get permission from the chair!

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.580
Otherwise you will not be allowed to speak!

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.680
I move Madam President be replaced.

00:21:24.140 --> 00:21:29.120
She cannot preside over this discussion without personal bias.

00:21:29.940 --> 00:21:34.250
I move to replace her with someone not associated with the Sorority!

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:36.540
Rei...!

00:21:36.870 --> 00:21:41.400
That's right! The Sorority president shouldn't preside over the student body!

00:21:41.520 --> 00:21:43.910
Yes, please resign as student body president!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:47.450
Let's stop kissing up to the Sorority!

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:48.980
Replace Madam President!

00:21:49.760 --> 00:21:51.350
Replace Madam President!

00:21:57.820 --> 00:22:03.130
A problem like this is not one for discussion solely among ourselves!

00:22:03.250 --> 00:22:09.080
We have to consult the school board members, teachers, and the alumni.

00:22:09.330 --> 00:22:12.430
Please, don't allow your emotions to get out of control!

00:22:12.550 --> 00:22:14.210
Who's out of control?

00:22:14.330 --> 00:22:19.040
We're certain we can get the necessary two-thirds majority.

00:22:19.050 --> 00:22:20.100
Go right ahead, then,

00:22:20.220 --> 00:22:24.920
...if you think you can so easily abolish this venerated tradition.

00:22:34.390 --> 00:22:35.220
<i>My dear brother,</i>

00:22:35.340 --> 00:22:39.620
<i>...thus, the stormy assembly came to an end.</i>

00:22:40.340 --> 00:22:43.940
<i>Nothing was decided, nothing was settled.</i>

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:47.540
<i>But clearly, that day, something had begun.</i>

00:22:50.320 --> 00:22:52.840
It's been on my mind a lot, since then.

00:22:53.050 --> 00:22:55.190
What's the best thing for her?

00:22:58.210 --> 00:23:01.930
I helped you out because of what I decided.

00:23:05.290 --> 00:23:08.400
She doesn't have to always be in a rose garden.

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:12.050
She can be her beautiful and proud self without that.

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:18.060
If she persists in clinging to those thorny roses,

00:23:18.370 --> 00:23:19.640
...they might someday pull her down,

00:23:19.760 --> 00:23:21.820
...her and her pride both.

00:23:22.560 --> 00:23:23.950
That's what I was thinking.

00:23:28.500 --> 00:23:31.930
Her exquisite dignity and sense of self,

00:23:32.250 --> 00:23:33.720
...I want her to keep all that,

00:23:34.020 --> 00:23:35.700
...because that's the person she is.

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...
